on and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations (MD&A) section you will find discussion of our overall performance results for our business segments, which are as follows:","block":122,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-051422","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000106535","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/106535/000119312526051422/wy-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/abf4024ff6d891854e12bc51d2ea034adf6433d66e8a2a326a5030f52672ed2e.bin","sha256":"abf4024ff6d891854e12bc51d2ea034adf6433d66e8a2a326a5030f52672ed2e"}},{"id":"052756bf56ec75632133149050e3c759e738505992a86218b4a58854ab225c16","quote":"a risk-based safety system to prevent incidents by:","context":"","section":"In our Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations (MD&A) section you will find discussion of our overall performance results for our business segments, which are as follows:","block":124,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-051422","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000106535","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/106535/000119312526051422/wy-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/abf4024ff6d891854e12bc51d2ea034adf6433d66e8a2a326a5030f52672ed2e.bin","sha256":"abf4024ff6d891854e12bc51d2ea034adf6433d66e8a2a326a5030f52672ed2e"}},{"id":"6009636e2c97ff840ae8627c0f644224a8afbd3d69ba05504666d95e388d3fba","quote":"We are committed to continual improvement and do so through annual prevention-based goals, our internal Safety Council, external benchmarking, implementation of new technology, replicating key learnings and enhancing our safety system and process. Our efforts have resulted in a significant and sustained reduction in the number and severity of recordable 